        "id": "is-online-exam-help-allowed",
        "title": "5. Is Online Exam Help Allowed?",
        "content": "\n        <p>All preparation completed <strong>prior to launching an official examination</strong>—including private tutoring, study groups, revision planning, and hardware diagnostic checks—is fully permitted and encouraged by educational institutions worldwide.</p>\n        <p>However, receiving assistance <strong>during an active proctored assessment</strong> is strictly prohibited unless specifically authorized in your instructor's syllabus or official candidate handbook. To read a detailed breakdown of academic integrity guidelines and testing options, read our guide on <a href=\"/blog/can-someone-take-an-exam-for-you\">Can Someone Take an Exam for You? Your Options Explained</a>.</p>\n      "
