        "title": "3. Breaking Major Assignments Into Manageable Stages",
        "content": "\n        <p>Attempting to write a 10-page research paper or complete a major case study in a single evening leads to superficial analysis and poor grades. Divide long-term projects into distinct stages:</p>\n        <table className=\"w-full text-xs sm:text-sm text-left border-collapse my-4\">\n          <thead>\n            <tr className=\"bg-brand-navy text-white font-bold\">\n              <th className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Project Stage</th>\n              <th className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Recommended Timeline</th>\n              <th className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Key Action Checklist</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody className=\"divide-y divide-brand-border/60 text-brand-muted font-medium\">\n            <tr className=\"bg-white\">\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border font-bold text-brand-navy\">Stage 1: Rubric & Topic Analysis</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">10–14 days before deadline</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Deconstruct assignment prompt, review instructor criteria, select core thesis topic.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border font-bold text-brand-navy\">Stage 2: Literature Research & Outlining</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">7–10 days before deadline</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Gather peer-reviewed sources, organize reference notes, build paragraph-by-paragraph outline.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"bg-white\">\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border font-bold text-brand-navy\">Stage 3: First Draft Writing</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">4–6 days before deadline</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Draft core body paragraphs focusing on analytical argument flow rather than perfect grammar.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"bg-slate-50\">\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border font-bold text-brand-navy\">Stage 4: Feedback & Revision</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">2–3 days before deadline</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Review draft against rubric criteria, seek 1-on-1 tutor feedback, refine logic transitions.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr className=\"bg-white\">\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border font-bold text-brand-navy\">Stage 5: Final Proofing & Submission</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">24 hours before deadline</td>\n              <td className=\"p-3 border border-brand-border\">Check APA/MLA formatting, verify bibliography links, upload file to LMS portal.</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      "
